            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngw Abalewi, kuko badafise umugabane cank’ ishamvu muri mwebge, bo n’ inyambukīra, n’impfuvyi, n’abapfakazi, baba i wanyu, babone kuza, barye, bahāge; kugira ng’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu abahezagire mu bikorwa mukora vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
